  "details": "When using fbt of any type, remote users will see substantial positional jitter of the root of the avatar. \n\nIn the provided video, the left screen is local user, right screen is remote user. The left foot and body are slime trackers, right foot is vive tracker.\n\nYou can clearly see the positional jitter for remote user even in an empty,optimized instance. This behavior gets worse in large instances.",
